repository-code: "https://github.com/mjgplab/proprep"
url: "https://anaconda.org/mjgplab/proprep"
abstract: >-
  ProPrep is a prompt-driven workflow manager for preparing protein and
  metalloprotein structures for molecular dynamics and QM/MM simulations with
  the Amber suite. It covers structure retrieval and curation, in silico
  mutagenesis, structure repair, protonation state assignment, force field
  selection, parameterization of small molecules, modified amino acids and
  metal sites, topology generation, and simulation setup and analysis. Every
  interaction is recorded to a session log that can be replayed, edited, or
  turned into a template for batch processing.
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - QM/MM
  - structure preparation
  - force field parameterization
  - metalloproteins
  - Amber
